<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Spring-Boot on YoSQL</title><link>https://yosql.projects.metio.wtf/tags/spring-boot/</link><description>Recent content in Spring-Boot on YoSQL</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en</language><lastBuildDate>Sun, 02 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://yosql.projects.metio.wtf/tags/spring-boot/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Spring Boot</title><link>https://yosql.projects.metio.wtf/frameworks/spring-boot/</link><pubDate>Sun, 02 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://yosql.projects.metio.wtf/frameworks/spring-boot/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Five minutes, and no &lt;code&gt;YoSQL&lt;/code&gt; dependency on your runtime classpath at the end of it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id="the-build"&gt;The build&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Add the plugin. Spring Boot&amp;rsquo;s own configuration is untouched:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-xml" data-lang="xml"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;&amp;lt;build&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="nt"&gt;&amp;lt;plugins&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="nt"&gt;&amp;lt;plugin&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="nt"&gt;&amp;lt;groupId&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;wtf.metio.yosql&lt;span class="nt"&gt;&amp;lt;/groupId&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="nt"&gt;&amp;lt;artifactId&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;yosql-tooling-maven&lt;span class="nt"&gt;&amp;lt;/artifactId&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="nt"&gt;&amp;lt;version&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;2026.8.8&lt;span class="nt"&gt;&amp;lt;/version&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="nt"&gt;&amp;lt;executions&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="nt"&gt;&amp;lt;execution&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="nt"&gt;&amp;lt;goals&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="nt"&gt;&amp;lt;goal&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;generate&lt;span class="nt"&gt;&amp;lt;/goal&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="nt"&gt;&amp;lt;/goals&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="nt"&gt;&amp;lt;/execution&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="nt"&gt;&amp;lt;/executions&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="nt"&gt;&amp;lt;configuration&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="nt"&gt;&amp;lt;repositories&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="nt"&gt;&amp;lt;basePackageName&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;com.example.persistence&lt;span class="nt"&gt;&amp;lt;/basePackageName&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="nt"&gt;&amp;lt;/repositories&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="nt"&gt;&amp;lt;annotations&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="nt"&gt;&amp;lt;repositoryAnnotations&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;org.springframework.stereotype.Repository&lt;span class="nt"&gt;&amp;lt;/repositoryAnnotations&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="nt"&gt;&amp;lt;/annotations&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="nt"&gt;&amp;lt;/configuration&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="nt"&gt;&amp;lt;/plugin&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="nt"&gt;&amp;lt;/plugins&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;&amp;lt;/build&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;repositoryAnnotations&lt;/code&gt; puts &lt;code&gt;@Repository&lt;/code&gt; on every generated class, so component scanning finds them
and constructor injection gives each one the application&amp;rsquo;s &lt;code&gt;DataSource&lt;/code&gt;. No &lt;code&gt;@Bean&lt;/code&gt; methods, no
configuration class.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>